ok 19 - the resource carries no person, account, acting-party, token-hash or capability-snapshot identifier [P2-S11-AC-025]
ok 20 - exactly one audit record commits and NO outbox event is emitted (BE03b: audit, no outbox) [P2-S11-AC-028]
