ok 25 - an exact replay re-derives the identical token (same resource) and adds no second token row, audit record, reservation or event [P2-S11-AC-117]
ok 26 - the replay is marked with the x-cms-idempotent-replay response header [P2-S11-AC-026]
ok 27 - the same key with a changed request is IDEMPOTENCY_MISMATCH [P2-S11-AC-026]
ok 28 - an exact replay after the entry version moved still returns the same token: replay is answered before the If-Match check [P2-S11-AC-026]
ok 29 - a new Idempotency-Key mints a new token with a fresh nonce; both tokens stay valid until their own expiry [P2-S11-AC-117]
ok 30 - a replay after the token expired is the typed preview_expired (a new key mints a new token) [P2-S11-AC-117]
ok 31 - a replay after the token was revoked is the typed preview_expired [P2-S11-AC-117]
