ok 32 - a member with no scope, an unassigned reviewer, a non-member, an absent entry, a revision of another entry, an archived entry and another acting party are ONE indistinguishable NOT_FOUND [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 33 - a held entry loads; a revision id alone resolves its entry; neither an entry nor a revision is INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 34 - an unknown phase, a missing phase or context, an unknown member and a malformed id are INVALID_REQUEST [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 35 - a document above 1 MiB is the uniform NOT_FOUND (the Worker then sends no evidence) [P2-S11-AC-101]
ok 36 - the load writes nothing: no audit record, event, reservation, review, schedule or publication is created or changed [P2-S11-AC-101]
